## First test

A CIPP priority, an allocation and an approval remain three distinct concepts.
The fixture fails if it promotes priority status into finance.

## Actions and exit criteria

Retrieve every frozen Indonesia census item with raw-byte/hash provenance;
extract candidates deterministically; review dispositions and admit only
supported canonical facts. Preserve source currency, stage/date precision,
project identity and unknowns. Complete only when every census item has a
documented disposition and a clean replay reproduces the candidate set.

